2.0.0
-----
* C++17/public-ABI release with versioned CMake and pkg-config packages.
* Ported the pinned LibreCAD DXFRW implementation, including DXF raw-carrier
  preservation, DWG reader/writer paths, bounded diagnostics, and transaction
  safety.
* Added dependency-free fast tests, opt-in long fuzzing, sanitizer coverage,
  installed-consumer checks, and an explicit LibreCAD system-package check.
* DWG and advanced preservation claims remain experimental until independent
  semantic evidence is available; external-only follow-ups remain deferred.

0.6.0
First  version with dwg read support

0.6.2
Support for VC++ 2013
